    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The proposed removal of the principal entrance door would erode the original character of the building, where currently this provides a clear, legible entrance, consistent with the attractive terrace row. This loss of historic fabric is considered harmful to the character and appearance of the host dwelling and wider conservation area and is contrary to Policies 53 and 72 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
